# Analyzer false-negative knowledge base. The .db is your accumulated notes -
# irreplaceable, but binary, so it is kept out of git; back it up separately.
# The -wal/-shm sidecars are transient SQLite state and must never be committed.
annotations/*.db
annotations/*.db-wal
annotations/*.db-shm
